{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Braiding.mobius_energy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Braiding.mobius_energy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.mobius_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.mobius_energy","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L44-L57","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)$ be a quantum observable universe\n([Definition](#def:quantum-observable-universe)) with substrate\nparameter $q$ ([Definition](#def:substrate-parameter)),\ncategorical action $\\mathfrak{S}_q$\n([Definition](#def:categorical-action)), and $q$-Hodge star\n$\\star_q$ ([Definition](#def:q-hodge-star)).\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:mobius-energy","label":"prop:mobius-energy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/mobius-energy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.claim_mobius_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.claim_mobius_energy","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Manuscript identity: in the classical limit `q → 1`, the\ncategorical Möbius energy recovers the classical Möbius\nenergy up to a topological normalisation.\n\nThe hypothesis is `q = 1` on the **inherited** substrate parameter\n`q : R`.  It previously read `q_real = 1` for a private `q_real : ℝ`\nthat was tied to the context's own `q` by nothing at all, so the\nantecedent constrained an unrelated free real and the \"classical limit\"\nwas not a limit of this universe's substrate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.c_topo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.c_topo","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Topological normalisation constant `c_topo`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.E_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.E_class","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Classical Möbius energy `E_class(ρ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.E_cat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.E_cat","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Categorical Möbius energy `E_cat(ρ)`.\n\nThese three energies stay at `ℝ` on purpose (§7c): the Möbius energy is\na classical real-analytic functional of a curve, and this claim is the\n*archimedean* statement that the categorical energy reproduces it in the\nclassical limit.  That is content on the far side of the\nsubstrate→archimedean wall.  What does not belong at `ℝ` is the\nsubstrate parameter — see below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L19-L19","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L19-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.MobiusEnergyContext","kind":"class","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/mobius_energy.lean#L16-L42","doc":"Abstract context for the `mobius_energy` claim — extends\n`QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceContext` for the shared substrate / Hecke /\nMarkov-trace structure, plus a block-specific Prop field. ","signatureChunk":0}]}